<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Baba Yogiraj Club</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:sans-serif;background:#fffde7;text-align:center}
header{background:white;padding:20px}
.logo{width:180px;height:180px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid #4e342e;object-fit:cover}
.banner{width:98%;max-width:900px;border-radius:10px;margin:15px auto;border:3px solid gold;display:block}
.footer{background:#3e2723;color:white;padding:15px;margin-top:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<img src="logo.jpg" class="logo">
<h1>श्री श्री सरस्वती पूजा महोत्सव</h1>
<h2>बाबा योगी राज क्लब, चियांकी</h2>
</header>
<img src="puja-poster.jpg" class="banner">
<div class="footer">जय माँ सरस्वती!</div>
</body>
</html>
